---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Joki Tugas IT | Jasa Bantu Tugas Networking, Database & Pemrograman"
	description="Joki tugas IT untuk mahasiswa — tugas jaringan, database, pemrograman, dan desain sistem dikerjakan oleh developer berpengalaman. Garansi selesai dan berkualitas."
	lang="en"
>
	<section class="service-page">
		<div class="container">
			<h1>Joki Tugas IT</h1>
			<p class="service-lead">
				Struggling with IT assignments? Get expert help for networking, database, programming, and system design tasks — delivered by experienced developers who understand academic requirements.
			</p>
			<div class="service-content">
				<h2>What We Cover</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Networking &amp; Network Configuration</li>
					<li>Database Design &amp; SQL Queries</li>
					<li>Programming Assignments (Python, Java, C, JavaScript)</li>
					<li>System Design &amp; Architecture</li>
					<li>Web Development Tasks</li>
					<li>Mobile App Development Tasks</li>
					<li>API &amp; Backend Assignments</li>
					<li>IT &amp; Network Maintenance Tasks</li>
				</ul>
				<h2>Why Choose Us</h2>
				<ul>
					<li>Experienced software developers with real-world expertise</li>
					<li>On-time delivery for every assignment</li>
					<li>Clean, well-documented code</li>
					<li>Affordable rates for students</li>
					<li>Free consultation before ordering</li>
				</ul>
				<h2>How It Works</h2>
				<ol>
					<li>Submit your assignment details</li>
					<li>Get a free quote and timeline</li>
					<li>We complete your task</li>
					<li>Review and request revisions if needed</li>
				</ol>
				<p class="cta-text">
					Ready to get help? <a href="/#contact">Contact us</a> for a free consultation.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
